    [10587]={name="Goblin Bomb Dispenser",quality=1,ilvl=46,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering",proc="Use: Creates a mobile bomb that charges the nearest enemy and explodes for 315 to 385 fire damage. (30 Min Cooldown)"},
    [10637]={name="Brewer's Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Sample for Helbrim'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Apothecary Zinge in The Barrens. Objective: Bring the Wolf Heart Sample to Apothecary Helbrim in the Barrens.",zone="Undercity",questName="Sample for Helbrim",lore="A colleague in Kalimdor, Apothecary Helbrim, is researching the effects of Lordaeron toxins on the beasts of Kalimdor. He would be very interested in a sample of the wolf hearts Renferrel sent me."},
    [10638]={name="Long Draping Cape",quality=2,ilvl=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Sample for Helbrim'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Apothecary Zinge in The Barrens. Objective: Bring the Wolf Heart Sample to Apothecary Helbrim in the Barrens.",zone="Undercity",questName="Sample for Helbrim",lore="A colleague in Kalimdor, Apothecary Helbrim, is researching the effects of Lordaeron toxins on the beasts of Kalimdor. He would be very interested in a sample of the wolf hearts Renferrel sent me."},
    [10653]={name="Trailblazer Boots",quality=2,ilvl=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Horde Presence'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Kadrak in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Kill the leader of the Talon Den, Rynthariel the Keymaster.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Horde Presence",lore="This scroll is from that scheming dryad Rynthariel, Keymaster of the Talon Den on Stonetalon Peak. She'll not be making any more contact with the messenger you looted this from, heh, but we must stand our ground here."},
    [10696]={name="Enchanted Azsharite Felbane Sword",quality=2,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Enchanted Azsharite Fel Weaponry'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Galvan the Ancient in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Wait for Galvan to finish forging the weaponry.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Enchanted Azsharite Fel Weaponry",lore="the creation of each weapon will take some time. Additionally, you may only use the power of the Felcurse once per three minutes. Its weakening properties against Razelikh the Defiler and his minions may be variable in duration.",proc="Use: Weakens the servants of Razelikh the Defiler. Must be within close proximity of the target to activate."},
    [10697]={name="Enchanted Azsharite Felbane Dagger",quality=2,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Enchanted Azsharite Fel Weaponry'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Galvan the Ancient in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Wait for Galvan to finish forging the weaponry.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Enchanted Azsharite Fel Weaponry",lore="the creation of each weapon will take some time. Additionally, you may only use the power of the Felcurse once per three minutes. Its weakening properties against Razelikh the Defiler and his minions may be variable in duration.",proc="Use: Weakens the servants of Razelikh the Defiler. Must be within close proximity of the target to activate."},
    [10703]={name="Fiendish Skiv",quality=2,ilvl=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Challenge Overlord Mok'Morokk'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Defeat Mok'Morokk and report the news to Draz'Zilb in Brackenwall Village.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Challenge Overlord Mok'Morokk",lore="You dare challenge Overlord Mok'Morokk? Haw! Me crush tiny! You tell me when ready for good beating."},
    [10727]={name="Goblin Dragon Gun",quality=1,ilvl=48,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering",proc="Use: Deals 61 to 69 fire damage for 10 sec to all targets in a cone in front of the engineer using the weapon.   That is unless it explodes..... (5 Min Cooldown)"},
    [10741]={name="Lordrec Helmet",quality=2,ilvl=53,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rise, Obsidion!'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Dying Archaeologist in Searing Gorge. Objective: Slay Lathoric the Black and Obsidion, and return to Thorius in Ironforge with the Head of Lathoric the Black and the Heart of Obsidion.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="Rise, Obsidion!",lore="It... It... It was all a trap. Forgive... me. Kill the bastard... Kill him for us... for Thorius."},
    [10742]={name="Dragonflight Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=51,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Set Them Ablaze!'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Squire Maltrake in Searing Gorge. Objective: Set the North, South, East, and West Sentry Towers on fire by using the Torch of Retribution inside each of the buildings.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="Set Them Ablaze!",lore="Listen well. While the four towers can never be destroyed, you can use the torch of retribution to set them ablaze for a very long period of time: A fire that no element or force can subdue."},
    [10745]={name="Kaylari Shoulders",quality=2,ilvl=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Prayer to Elune'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Zamael Lunthistle in Searing Gorge. Objective: Hear Zamael tell his tale.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="Prayer to Elune",lore="Will you assist me, mortal? Will you find the prayer to Elune? As I stated, the prayer was etched onto a golden tablet. One of these idol worshipping scoundrels must have it on their person."},
    [10748]={name="Wanderlust Boots",quality=2,ilvl=41,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mazen's Behest'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mazen Mac'Nadir in Stormwind City. Objective: Speak with Acolyte Dellis in Stormwind.",zone="Stormwind City",questName="Mazen's Behest",lore="Master Mazen's directions were quite clear: Deliver a very important essay to Watcher Mahar Ba in Nethergarde Keep. But I had never been to the Blasted Lands before!"},
    [10762]={name="Robes of the Lich",quality=3,ilvl=44,reqLevel=37,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Amnennar the Coldbringer.",zone="Razorfen Downs",npc="Amnennar the Coldbringer"},
    [10765]={name="Bonefingers",quality=3,ilvl=43,reqLevel=37,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Amnennar the Coldbringer.",zone="Razorfen Downs",npc="Amnennar the Coldbringer"},
    [10781]={name="Hakkari Breastplate",quality=3,ilvl=55,sourceType="container",instructions="Found inside another item."},
    [10782]={name="Hakkari Shroud",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="container",instructions="Found inside another item."},
    [10801]={name="Slitherscale Boots",quality=3,ilvl=52,reqLevel=47,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Spawn of Hakkar.",zone="Sunken Temple",npc="Spawn of Hakkar"},
    [10804]={name="Fist of the Damned",quality=3,ilvl=54,reqLevel=49,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ogom the Wretched.",zone="Sunken Temple",npc="Ogom the Wretched",proc="Chance on hit: Steals 30 life from target enemy."},
    [10821]={name="Sower's Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mura Runetotem'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Tonga Runetotem in Silverpine Forest. Objective: Speak with Mura Runetotem in the Sepulcher.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Mura Runetotem",lore="My clanmate, Mura Runetotem, traveled to Silverpine so that she might aid our undead allies. Silverpine is an ailing forest, a dying forest, and it was Mura's hope to bring it new life."},
    [10838]={name="Might of Hakkar",quality=3,ilvl=54,reqLevel=49,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Avatar of Hakkar (rare elite).",npc="Avatar of Hakkar"},
    [11086]={name="Jang'thraze the Protector",quality=3,ilvl=50,reqLevel=45,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Chief Ukorz Sandscalp.",zone="Zul'Farrak",npc="Chief Ukorz Sandscalp",proc="Use: Combines Jang'thraze and Sang'thraze to form the mighty sword, Sul'thraze."},
    [11120]={name="Belgrom's Hammer",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Betrayed'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ag'tor Bloodfist in Orgrimmar. Objective: Speak to Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Betrayed",lore="Return to Belgrom in Orgrimmar. He will want to see her head for himself! We'll return there shortly. Ah, this is indeed a good day. Thank you for your help."},
    [11193]={name="Blazewind Breastplate",quality=2,ilvl=57,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Tremors of the Earth'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Garek in Badlands. Objective: Use the Sign of the Earth to activate the Pillars of Amethyst, Opal, and Diamond and obtain the Runestones.Place the runestones in the Seal of the Earth to free Blacklash and Hematus.Slay them and return Blacklash's Bindings, the Chains of Hematus, and the Sign of the Earth to Garek.",zone="Badlands",questName="Tremors of the Earth",lore="It has become obvious that we cannot ensure that Blacklash and Hematus will remain imprisoned in Lethlor."},
    [11303]={name="Fine Shortbow",quality=2,ilvl=16,reqLevel=11,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Abigail Sawyer.",zone="Undercity",npc="Abigail Sawyer"},
    [11304]={name="Fine Longbow",quality=2,ilvl=19,reqLevel=14,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Wallace the Blind.",zone="Pyrewood Village",npc="Wallace the Blind"},
    [11502]={name="Loreskin Shoulders",quality=2,ilvl=46,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Apothecary Zinge'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Undercity. Objective: Bring the Sealed Field Testing Kit to Apothecary Zinge in the Undercity.",zone="Undercity",questName="Return to Apothecary Zinge",lore="\"Here you go, the power source is safely removed and the data is preserved. Well, safe journeys and all that."},
    [11628]={name="Houndmaster's Bow",quality=3,ilvl=53,reqLevel=48,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Houndmaster Grebmar.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="Houndmaster Grebmar"},
    [11686]={name="Girdle of Beastial Fury",quality=3,ilvl=55,reqLevel=50,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Eviscerator (rare elite).",npc="Eviscerator"},
    [11764]={name="Cinderhide Armsplints",quality=3,ilvl=57,reqLevel=52,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Lord Incendius.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="Lord Incendius"},
    [11810]={name="Force of Will",quality=3,ilvl=60,reqLevel=55,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from General Angerforge.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="General Angerforge"},
    [11811]={name="Smoking Heart of the Mountain",quality=3,ilvl=55,reqLevel=50,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Enchanting (requires skill 1).",profession="Enchanting"},
    [11812]={name="Cape of the Fire Salamander",quality=3,ilvl=58,reqLevel=53,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ambassador Flamelash.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="Ambassador Flamelash",lore="Ragnaros's envoy to the Dark Iron in Blackrock Depths, sent to keep the dwarves loyal to the Firelord."},
    [11853]={name="Rambling Boots",quality=2,ilvl=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Stolen Silver'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gazrog in The Barrens. Objective: Bring the Stolen Silver to Gazrog in the Crossroads.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Stolen Silver",lore="You may have killed the raptors, but the silver they stole must be recovered! I have reports that the raptors have a large grouping of nests south of Ratchet, known as the Raptor Grounds."},
    [11856]={name="Ceremonial Elven Blade",quality=2,ilvl=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Hero's Welcome'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ginro Hearthkindle in Feralas. Objective: Speak with Shandris Feathermoon in Feathermoon Stronghold.",zone="Feralas",questName="A Hero's Welcome",lore="General Shandris Feathermoon would like to speak with you personally."},
    [11858]={name="Battlehard Cape",quality=2,ilvl=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Grim Discovery'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Krueg Skullsplitter in Orgrimmar. Objective: Bring the Crate of Grimtotem Horns to Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar.",zone="Feralas",questName="A Grim Discovery",lore="What?! Ah, so I did mention a bounty, didn't I? Well, that'll teach me to open my mouth, won't it? You did the work, so I suppose it is only right you reap the greatest reward from it."},
    [11862]={name="White Bone Band",quality=2,ilvl=52,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bone-Bladed Weapons'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Bone-Bladed Weapons",lore="In Un'Goro Crater there be raptors with deadly claws. Some of those raptors sometimes have white claws instead of ones black like death."},
    [11863]={name="White Bone Shredder",quality=2,ilvl=52,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bone-Bladed Weapons'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Bone-Bladed Weapons",lore="In Un'Goro Crater there be raptors with deadly claws. Some of those raptors sometimes have white claws instead of ones black like death."},
    [11871]={name="Snarkshaw Spaulders",quality=2,ilvl=54,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Calm Before the Storm'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gracina Spiritmight in Darnassus. Objective: Bring the Bank Voucher to Idriana in the bank of Darnassus.",zone="Darnassus",questName="Calm Before the Storm",lore="your help has been immeasurable. The time will come, no doubt, when I'll ask for your assistance against the silithid once more."},
    [11874]={name="Clouddrift Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=56,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ancient Spirit'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Arei in Ashenvale. Objective: Escort Arei to safety, then speak with Kayneth Stillwind in Forest Song, in eastern Ashenvale.",zone="Felwood",questName="Ancient Spirit",lore="Felwood was once a peaceful and serene land... Until the legion took hold. The infernals, destruction, chaos... The skull of Gul'dan ensured that none were spared here."},
    [11876]={name="Plainstalker Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=56,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Bait for Lar'korwi'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Torwa Pathfinder in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Using the contents of Torwa's Pouch, summon Lar'korwi and defeat him. Then bring Lar'korwi's Head to Torwa Pathfinder near the entrance to Un'Goro Crater.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="The Bait for Lar'korwi",lore="This will be the most difficult part because there is some complexity to the plan. To the north of here, you will find a small trail into the mountains."},
    [11884]={name="Moonlit Amice",quality=2,ilvl=33,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Vahlarriel'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Desolace",questName="Return to Vahlarriel",lore="So, the time is now then? I appreciate your efforts, and if the situation does not lend itself, then allow me to thank you now for everything you've done for me and my family."},
    [11902]={name="Linken's Sword of Mastery",quality=2,ilvl=56,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'It's Dangerous to Go Alone'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Linken in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Travel to Fire Plume Ridge, south of Marshal's Refuge.Find Blazerunner and use the totem to remove his protective aura. Once he has been defeated, acquire the Golden Flame from the cave.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="It's Dangerous to Go Alone",lore="I finally remember now... I did come here to fight Blazerunner. I was on a journey, and this was to be the last step. But I am no longer the hero...",proc="Chance on hit: Blasts a target for 45 to 75 Nature damage."},
    [11905]={name="Linken's Boomerang",quality=2,ilvl=56,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'It's Dangerous to Go Alone'. Starts with Linken in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Travel to Fire Plume Ridge, south of Marshal's Refuge.Find Blazerunner and use the totem to remove his protective aura. Once he has been defeated, acquire the Golden Flame from the cave.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="It's Dangerous to Go Alone",lore="I finally remember now... I did come here to fight Blazerunner. I was on a journey, and this was to be the last step. But I am no longer the hero...",proc="Use: Flings a magical boomerang towards target enemy dealing 113 to 187 damage and has a chance to stun or disarm them. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [11906]={name="Beastsmasher",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Mighty U'cha'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Torwa Pathfinder in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Bring U'cha's Pelt to Torwa Pathfinder at the entrance of Un'Goro Crater.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="The Mighty U'cha",lore="While you have been exploring Un'Goro, I have seen other things that a mighty hunter such as yourself would relish in. One such sight was a huge ape among the other gorillas to the north."},
    [11916]={name="Shizzle's Muzzle",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Shizzle's Flyer'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Un'Goro Crater. Objective: Collect 8 Webbed Diemetradon Scales and 8 Webbed Pterrordax Scales for Shizzle in Marshal's Refuge.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="Shizzle's Flyer",lore="I'm making a flying machine! I got stranded here, and I'm absolutely horrible at finding my way around. I'd take a gryphon or wind rider back to Gadgetzan, but those beasts just scare me to death."},
    [11945]={name="Dark Iron Ring",quality=2,ilvl=53,reqLevel=48,sourceType="object_drop",instructions="Found in a container.",npc="a container"},
    [11946]={name="Fire Opal Necklace",quality=2,ilvl=52,reqLevel=47,sourceType="object_drop",instructions="Found in a container.",npc="a container"},
    [11963]={name="Penance Spaulders",quality=2,ilvl=53,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ribbly Screwspigot'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Yuka Screwspigot in Burning Steppes. Objective: Bring Ribbly's Head to Yuka Screwspigot in the Burning Steppes.",zone="Blackrock Depths",questName="Ribbly Screwspigot",lore="My brother Ribbly has always been a drain to his family, taking our money and wasting it on one scheme after another."},
    [11964]={name="Swiftstrike Cudgel",quality=3,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hurley Blackbreath'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ragnar Thunderbrew in Dun Morogh. Objective: Bring the Lost Thunderbrew Recipe to Ragnar Thunderbrew in Kharanos.",zone="Blackrock Depths",questName="Hurley Blackbreath",lore="The Dark Iron dwarves, led by the villain Hurley Blackbreath, stole one of the Thunderbrew's best recipes, Thunderbrew Lager. The villains! They don't deserve such a fine brew!, I have a tough task for you."},
