    [15396]={name="Curvewood Dagger",quality=2,ilvl=14,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Fragments Within'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Darkshore. Objective: Report back what you have found to Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea in Auberdine.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Fragments Within",lore="The moonwell water has revealed that embedded inside the crystal are a few small fragments of bone, as well as half of a jawbone."},
    [15399]={name="Dryweed Belt",quality=2,ilvl=14,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Washed Ashore'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Darkshore. Objective: Recover the Sea Turtle Remains from the Skeletal Sea Turtle in the waters west of Auberdine, and then speak with Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde back in Auberdine.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Washed Ashore",lore="That beached creature is not an isolated incident here in Darkshore. There are more along the coastline and even in the water."},
    [15403]={name="Ridgeback Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'WANTED: Murkdeep!'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Darkshore",questName="WANTED: Murkdeep!",lore="Attention! A reward is being offered for the death of the murloc \"Murkdeep\"."},
    [15431]={name="Peerless Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=59,reqLevel=54,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 38-61."},
    [15445]={name="Hammer of Orgrimmar",quality=2,ilvl=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hidden Enemies'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Thrall in Ragefire Chasm. Objective: Kill Bazzalan and Jergosh the Invoker before returning to Thrall in Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Hidden Enemies",lore="You are one of my lieutenants! Prepare yourself. I will call upon you soon. My time spent on the Searing Blade may be all but wasted now, but that does not mean that the Shadow Council's schemes elsewhere must suffer."},
    [15450]={name="Dredgemire Leggings",quality=3,ilvl=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Power to Destroy...'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Varimathras in Undercity. Objective: Bring the books Spells of Shadow and Incantations from the Nether to Varimathras in Undercity.",zone="Ragefire Chasm",questName="The Power to Destroy...",lore="Many denizens of the Legion bestow gifts on their followers as you may well know. Some of these gifts the Dark Lady feels would be better off in her hands than in the hands of those with..."},
    [15456]={name="Lightstep Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=37,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hints of a New Plague?'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Quae in Hillsbrad Foothills. Objective: Find Phin Odelic in Southshore.",zone="Hillsbrad Foothills",questName="Hints of a New Plague?",lore="I've seen Kinelory look way worse after a night in the tavern than she does now. You obviously did a good job protecting her."},
    [15457]={name="Desert Shoulders",quality=2,ilvl=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Grimtotem Spying'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Cliffwatcher Longhorn in Thousand Needles. Objective: Locate and retrieve the three Secret Notes in Darkcloud Pinnacle.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Grimtotem Spying",lore="you have served us well in the past, so I now entrust to you an important mission. The Grimtotem Clan is up to something secretive. Three agents of unknown origin were seen visiting the Grimtotem over the recent weeks."},
    [15462]={name="Loamflake Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Protect Kanati Greycloud'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Thousand Needles. Objective: Protect Kanati Greycloud from the centaur attack.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Protect Kanati Greycloud",lore="But, there may be more centaur than I thought, I ask you, to fight with me against these vile assassins."},
    [15467]={name="Inventor's League Ring",quality=2,ilvl=31,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hypercapacitor Gizmo'. Starts with Wizlo Bearingshiner in Thousand Needles. Objective: Slay the beast and bring back the Hypercapacitor Gizmo and Panther Cage Key to Wizlo Bearingshiner.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Hypercapacitor Gizmo",lore="I am the only survivor from our caravan attack by the centaur! A rare yet mighty panther is guarding my best gizmo, which is around his neck."},
    [15469]={name="Windsong Cinch",quality=2,ilvl=29,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Free at Last'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Lakota Windsong in Thousand Needles. Objective: Escort Lakota Windsong from the Darkcloud Pinnacle, and then talk to Thalia Amberhide at Freewind Post.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Free at Last",lore="Arnak thinks we're going to be married... but after I declined his offer he came back that night and kidnapped me. My brother tried to stop him, but Arnak was too strong."},
    [15471]={name="Brawnhide Armor",quality=2,ilvl=29,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wanted - Arnak Grimtotem'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Thousand Needles. Objective: Slay Arnak Grimtotem and bring proof of your deed to Cliffwatcher Longhorn in Freewind Post.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Wanted - Arnak Grimtotem",lore="Wanted: Arnak Grimtotem Arnak the outcast is wanted for the heinous crimes of murder and kidnapping. Handsome rewards will be given to those brave enough to bring this criminal to justice."},
    [15501]={name="Outrunner's Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=17,reqLevel=12,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 11-18."},
    [15519]={name="Spiked Chain Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 18-24."},
    [15526]={name="Sentry's Cape",quality=2,ilvl=24,reqLevel=19,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 19-26."},
    [15587]={name="Ringtail Girdle",quality=2,ilvl=35,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Clam Bait'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mai'Lahii in Desolace. Objective: Find 10 pieces of Soft-shelled Clam Meat and bring it back to Mai'Lahii at Shadowprey Village.",zone="Desolace",questName="Clam Bait",lore="You have the look of a fisherman! I love to fish - been fishing all my life. The best bait to use is soft-shelled clam meat; the fish just can't resist, you know what I mean?"},
    [15661]={name="Impenetrable Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=54,reqLevel=49,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 48-55."},
    [15689]={name="Trader's Ring",quality=2,ilvl=35,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bodyguard for Hire'.",zone="Desolace",questName="Bodyguard for Hire",lore="Under normal circumstances, Rigger and I would lead our kodo past the Kolkar Centaur. Every now and then we hear the Centaur war drums, and when we hear those we stop."},
    [15690]={name="Kodobone Necklace",quality=2,ilvl=41,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bone Collector'.",zone="Desolace",questName="Bone Collector",lore="We're sitting on a goldmine here, I tell you - a goldmine! Kodo bones will change the world forever... I have customers making furniture, music instruments, and even blasting powder out of them."},
    [15691]={name="Sidegunner Shottie",quality=2,ilvl=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gizelton Caravan'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Rigger Gizelton in Desolace. Objective: Escort the Gizelton Caravan through Mannoroc Coven. Talk with Smeed at Scrabblescrew's Camp for your reward.",zone="Desolace",questName="Gizelton Caravan",lore="You look like a capable. Perhaps you're looking to make some money? Cork and I started this caravan to make a bundle of money; little did we know the dangers of turning a buck!"},
    [15703]={name="Chemist's Smock",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Melding of Influences'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Chemist Fuely in Undercity. Objective: Bring a Merged Ooze Sample to Chemist Fuely in Undercity.",zone="Undercity",questName="Melding of Influences",lore="Here is some encased ooze created from the Felwood samples you recovered. Take the case to Un'Goro Crater and find a pure ooze... the primal variety will do nicely."},
    [15704]={name="Hunter's Insignia Medal",quality=2,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Past Endeavors'. The quest is in Winterspring. Objective: Bring Storm Shadowhoof's Marker to Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Past Endeavors",lore="Before you spoke to me, I had heard of your endeavors... that you had an unyielding desire to prove yourself, that you had an exceptional ability as a, and I now know these things to be the truth."},
    [15706]={name="Hunt Tracker Blade",quality=2,ilvl=57,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Remains of Trey Lightforge'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Felwood. Objective: Return the Remains of Trey Lightforge to Jessir Moonbow in Felwood.",zone="Felwood",questName="The Remains of Trey Lightforge",lore="You pick up the sack carefully and prepare to make your way back to Jessir Moonbow on the border of Felwood and Ashenvale. Hopefully the paladin will be given the proper respects once you've passed his remains on to his friends."},
    [15708]={name="Blight Leather Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=58,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Final Blow'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Greta Mosshoof in Felwood. Objective: Kill Moora and Salia, and bring Shadow Lord Fel'dan's Head to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood.",zone="Felwood",questName="A Final Blow",lore="Unfortunately, I see the only way to stop this threat to Felwood is a frontal attack. There are no other ways into Shadow Hold, and I have no means to teleport you inside."},
    [15783]={name="Beasthunter Dagger",quality=2,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Shy-Rotam'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Storm Shadowhoof in Winterspring. Objective: Storm Shadowhoof at Everlook in Winterspring wants you to defeat Shy-Rotam.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Shy-Rotam",lore="In northern Winterspring, great cats assemble around a large landmark called Frostsaber Rock. The leader of these cats is known by the name Shy-Rotam."},
    [15789]={name="Deep River Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=56,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Strange Sources'. Starts with Donova Snowden in Winterspring. Objective: Follow Donova Snowden's instructions, then report back.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Strange Sources",lore="To tell you the truth, although there are no volcanoes here in Winterspring, I believe that there are far more threatening reasons for these hot springs..."},
    [15799]={name="Heroic Commendation Medal",quality=2,ilvl=58,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mission Accomplished!'. Starts with High Executor Derrington in Tirisfal Glades. Objective: &lt;name&gt;, your successful re-engineering of the cauldrons is a tremendous victory for us!Let all within my presence hear: for service to the Forsaken and to the Horde as a whole above and beyond what was expected - in the face of overwhelming odds and incredible danger, might I add - I give &lt;name&gt; this, and I extend upon him our undying gratitude as a true hero of the Horde. &nbsp;Huzzah!",zone="Western Plaguelands",questName="Mission Accomplished!"},
    [15800]={name="Intrepid Shortsword",quality=2,ilvl=58,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mission Accomplished!'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with High Executor Derrington in Tirisfal Glades. Objective: &lt;name&gt;, your successful re-engineering of the cauldrons is a tremendous victory for us!Let all within my presence hear: for service to the Forsaken and to the Horde as a whole above and beyond what was expected - in the face of overwhelming odds and incredible danger, might I add - I give &lt;name&gt; this, and I extend upon him our undying gratitude as a true hero of the Horde. &nbsp;Huzzah!",zone="Western Plaguelands",questName="Mission Accomplished!"},
    [15804]={name="Cerise Drape",quality=2,ilvl=56,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Glyphed Oaken Branch'. Starts with Mulgris Deepriver in Darnassus. Objective: Based on the magic enchanted within the Glyphed Oaken Branch, its delivery to the Cenarion Circle in Darnassus is the next step the tauren druid sought. Seek one of the druids there for assistance.",zone="Western Plaguelands",questName="Glyphed Oaken Branch",lore="The lifeless hand of the tauren druid clutches a surprisingly healthy looking oaken branch. Examining the branch reveals glyphs of a druidic nature carved into the bark."},
    [15806]={name="Mirah's Song",quality=3,ilvl=61,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Kirtonos the Herald'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Eva Sarkhoff in Scholomance. Objective: Return to the Scholomance with the Blood of Innocents. Find the porch and place the Blood of Innocents in the brazier. Kirtonos will come to feast upon your soul.Fight valiantly, do not give an inch! Destroy Kirtonos and return to Eva Sarkhoff.",zone="Scholomance",questName="Kirtonos the Herald",lore="Mirah Chandler's song, given for finishing a chain of favours in the Barrens -- the reward players remember long after they forget the errands."},
    [15814]={name="Hameya's Slayer",quality=2,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hameya's Plea'. The quest is in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Kill Infiltrator Hameya. Use his key on the Mound of Dirt behind the Undercroft.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Hameya's Plea",lore="Kill me. Before it's too late. I am Hameya. While traveling to Zul'Mashar, my brethren and I ate some bad meat... and we changed. We are infected.",proc="Chance on hit: Wounds the target causing them to bleed for 80 damage over 30 sec."},
    [15822]={name="Shadowskin Spaulders",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Runecloth'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Meilosh in Felwood. Objective: Bring 30 Runecloth to Meilosh in Timbermaw Hold.",zone="Timbermaw Hold",questName="Runecloth",lore="In Timbermaw, we are content. We do not like strangers. This is good for us, but it is bad for trade. Not long ago, a rare night elf friend came to Timbermaw and she wore a runecloth cloak."},
    [15855]={name="Ring of Protection",quality=3,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hidden Treasures'. Starts with Pamela Redpath in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Bring Joseph's Key to Joseph's Chest.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Hidden Treasures",lore="Daddy told me to give you this key. He said it opens a chest out back behind the house. He also wanted me to thank you. Did you do a favor for him?"},
    [15861]={name="Swiftfoot Treads",quality=2,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Delivery to Ridgewell'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mayara Brightwing in Stormwind City. Objective: Bring Ridgewell's Crate to Remington Ridgewell in Stormwind.",zone="Blackrock Spire",questName="Delivery to Ridgewell",lore="I have packaged Doomriggers Clasp into a crate, suitable for shipment to Stormwind., you have been extremely helpful -- can I ask you for one last favor?"},
    [15863]={name="Grave Scepter",quality=2,ilvl=54,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Tinkee'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Return to Tinkee",lore="Ok, everything is prepared and packed and ready for transport! Good luck in your journey, and make sure you tell Tinkee that she owes me!"},
    [15903]={name="Right-Handed Claw",quality=1,ilvl=25,reqLevel=20,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Ariyell Skyshadow.",zone="Darnassus",npc="Ariyell Skyshadow"},
    [15904]={name="Right-Handed Blades",quality=1,ilvl=35,reqLevel=30,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Ariyell Skyshadow.",zone="Darnassus",npc="Ariyell Skyshadow"},
    [15905]={name="Right-Handed Brass Knuckles",quality=1,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Ariyell Skyshadow.",zone="Darnassus",npc="Ariyell Skyshadow"},
    [15906]={name="Left-Handed Brass Knuckles",quality=1,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Ariyell Skyshadow.",zone="Darnassus",npc="Ariyell Skyshadow"},
    [15907]={name="Left-Handed Claw",quality=1,ilvl=25,reqLevel=20,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Ariyell Skyshadow.",zone="Darnassus",npc="Ariyell Skyshadow"},
    [15909]={name="Left-Handed Blades",quality=1,ilvl=35,reqLevel=30,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Lissaf.",zone="Outland",npc="Lissaf"},
    [16007]={name="Flawless Arcanite Rifle",quality=3,ilvl=61,reqLevel=56,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering"},
    [16309]={name="Drakefire Amulet",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Drakefire Amulet'. Starts with Haleh in Winterspring. Objective: You must retrieve the Blood of the Black Dragon Champion from General Drakkisath. Drakkisath can be found in his throne room behind the Halls of Ascension in Blackrock Spire.",zone="Blackrock Spire",questName="Drakefire Amulet",lore="It is a piece of the dragon; a scale - enchanted and transformed. Whole, it could have granted access to the beast's lair. Shattered, it is useless."},
    [16335]={name="Senior Sergeant's Insignia",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=58,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Brave Stonehide - costs tokens or reputation.",npc="Brave Stonehide"},
    [16341]={name="Sergeant's Cloak",quality=3,ilvl=50,reqLevel=45,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from First Sergeant Hola'mahi - costs tokens or reputation.",npc="First Sergeant Hola'mahi"},
    [16342]={name="Sergeant's Cape",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=58,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Sergeant Major Clate - costs tokens or reputation.",npc="Sergeant Major Clate"},
    [16497]={name="First Sergeant's Leather Armguards",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=58,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from First Sergeant Hola'mahi - costs tokens or reputation.",npc="First Sergeant Hola'mahi"},
    [16658]={name="Wildhunter Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=32,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Hunt Completed'. Starts with Senani Thunderheart in Ashenvale. Objective: &lt;name&gt;, you have slain all three beasts that comprise the Ashenvale Hunt. &nbsp;You have brought me adequate proof of their demise; there is no question of your strength and tenacity. &nbsp;The blood of a hunter streaks through your veins, and you should be commended!Please, accept this bauble as a sign of congratulations on your mighty deeds done in Ashenvale for the Horde today. &nbsp;May your ancestors watch over you!",zone="Ashenvale",questName="The Hunt Completed"},
    [16659]={name="Deftkin Belt",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Je'neu of the Earthen Ring'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mastok Wrilehiss in Ashenvale. Objective: Bring the Befouled Water Globe to Je'neu Sancrea at Zoram'gar Outpost, Ashenvale.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Je'neu of the Earthen Ring",lore="The Earthen Ring is a shamanistic group dedicated to studying and preserving the elements. They have forgotten more about crazy old gods, ancient legends and lore than most scholars will ever know."},
    [16707]={name="Shadowcraft Cap",quality=3,ilvl=62,reqLevel=57,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Darkmaster Gandling (rare elite).",npc="Darkmaster Gandling"},
    [16708]={name="Shadowcraft Spaulders",quality=3,ilvl=60,reqLevel=55,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Cannon Master Willey.",zone="Stratholme",npc="Cannon Master Willey"},
    [16709]={name="Shadowcraft Pants",quality=3,ilvl=61,reqLevel=56,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Baron Rivendare.",zone="Stratholme",npc="Baron Rivendare"},
    [16710]={name="Shadowcraft Bracers",quality=3,ilvl=57,reqLevel=52,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Instructor Malicia.",zone="Scholomance",npc="Instructor Malicia"},
    [16711]={name="Shadowcraft Boots",quality=3,ilvl=59,reqLevel=54,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Rattlegore.",zone="Scholomance",npc="Rattlegore"},
    [16712]={name="Shadowcraft Gloves",quality=3,ilvl=59,reqLevel=54,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Shadow Hunter Vosh'gajin.",zone="Blackrock Spire",npc="Shadow Hunter Vosh'gajin"},
    [16713]={name="Shadowcraft Belt",quality=3,ilvl=58,reqLevel=53,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Blackhand Assassin.",zone="Blackrock Spire",npc="Blackhand Assassin"},
    [16721]={name="Shadowcraft Tunic",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=58,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from General Drakkisath.",zone="Blackrock Spire",npc="General Drakkisath"},
    [16739]={name="Rugwood Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Dunemaul Compound'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Andi Lynn in Tanaris. Objective: Andi Lynn in Gadgetzan wants you to destroy the Dunemaul Compound by killing 10 Dunemaul Brutes, 10 Dunemaul Enforcers, and Gor'marok the Ravager.",zone="Tanaris",questName="The Dunemaul Compound",lore="Just recently, a large band of nomadic ogres arrived in Tanaris. South of here, they have taken over a large area of the desert and formed a compound."},
    [16769]={name="Furbolg Medicine Totem",quality=2,ilvl=52,reqLevel=47,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Gorn One Eye.",zone="Timbermaw Hold",npc="Gorn One Eye"},
    [16820]={name="Nightslayer Chestpiece",quality=4,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Golemagg the Incinerator.",zone="Molten Core",npc="Golemagg the Incinerator",lore="A core rager grown past all the others, flanked by two hounds that cannot be killed while he stands."},
    [16821]={name="Nightslayer Cover",quality=4,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Garr.",zone="Molten Core",npc="Garr",lore="A lieutenant of Ragnaros who fights surrounded by his Firesworn, and grows stronger each time one of them falls."},
    [16822]={name="Nightslayer Pants",quality=4,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Magmadar.",zone="Molten Core",npc="Magmadar",lore="A core hound of the deep fire, kept as a guard beast and fed by Ragnaros's lieutenants."},
    [16824]={name="Nightslayer Boots",quality=4,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Shazzrah.",zone="Molten Core",npc="Shazzrah",lore="A flame imp given rank, and the reason the Core's casters cannot be left standing together."},
    [16827]={name="Nightslayer Belt",quality=4,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 60-63."},
    [16832]={name="Bloodfang Spaulders",quality=4,ilvl=76,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Chromaggus.",zone="Blackwing Lair",npc="Chromaggus",lore="Nefarian's best result: a two-headed chromatic horror carrying the breath of every dragonflight at once."},
    [16890]={name="Slatemetal Cutlass",quality=2,ilvl=24,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Torek's Assault'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Ashenvale. Objective: Escort Torek on his attack against Silverwing Outpost and Duriel Moonfire, then report to Ertog Ragetusk at Splintertree Post.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Torek's Assault",lore="Hey!! Come here! My raiders and I are about to attack the Silverwing Outpost to the west. Our target is its leader, Duriel Moonfire. Scouts report the outpost is defended heavily with sentinels and warriors."},
    [16891]={name="Claystone Shortsword",quality=2,ilvl=21,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Arachnophobia'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Kill Besseleth and bring Besseleth's Fang to Maggran at Sun Rock Retreat.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Arachnophobia",lore="Warning: Proceed into Sishir Canyon west of here at your own risk. Besseleth and her eight-legged children of the forest have claimed this canyon as their webbed lair."},
    [16906]={name="Bloodfang Boots",quality=4,ilvl=76,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Broodlord Lashlayer.",zone="Blackwing Lair",npc="Broodlord Lashlayer",lore="Nefarian's lieutenant, posted to hold the only way deeper into the lair."},
    [16907]={name="Bloodfang Gloves",quality=4,ilvl=76,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ebonroc.",zone="Blackwing Lair",npc="Ebonroc",lore="One of three drakes guarding Nefarian's inner lair, and the one that heals itself off the wounds it deals."},
    [16908]={name="Bloodfang Hood",quality=4,ilvl=76,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Onyxia.",zone="Onyxia's Lair",npc="Onyxia",lore="Deathwing's daughter and Nefarian's sister. She spent years in Stormwind as Lady Katrana Prestor, advising the throne she was working to undermine."},
    [16909]={name="Bloodfang Pants",quality=4,ilvl=76,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ragnaros.",npc="Ragnaros",lore="The Firelord, one of the four Elemental Lords, bound to the Elemental Plane until the Dark Iron dwarves summoned him under Blackrock Mountain. The summoning cracked the mountain open and made the Molten Core."},
    [16977]={name="Warsong Boots",quality=3,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Warsong Supplies'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Locke Okarr in Ashenvale. Objective: Collect the Warsong Supplies: Warsong Saw Blades, Logging Rope, Warsong Oil, and the Warsong Axe Shipment for Locke Okarr in Splintertree Post.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Warsong Supplies",lore="We are in short supply of a few items at the Warsong lumber camp!"},
    [16982]={name="Corehound Boots",quality=4,ilvl=59,reqLevel=54,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [16987]={name="Screecher Belt",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bloodfury Bloodline'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Maggran Earthbinder in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Maggran at Sun Rock Retreat wishes you to slay Bloodfury Ripper and bring her remains as proof of your deed.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Bloodfury Bloodline",lore="Limiting the number of Bloodfury Harpies will not be enough. The only true cure for their disease would be to slay their leader, Bloodfury Ripper!"},
    [16990]={name="Spritekin Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bloodfury Bloodline'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Maggran Earthbinder in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Maggran at Sun Rock Retreat wishes you to slay Bloodfury Ripper and bring her remains as proof of your deed.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Bloodfury Bloodline",lore="Limiting the number of Bloodfury Harpies will not be enough. The only true cure for their disease would be to slay their leader, Bloodfury Ripper!"},
    [16995]={name="Duskwing Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Duskwing, Oh How I Hate Thee...'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Nathanos Blightcaller in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Find Duskwing and slay him. From the corpse, recover a Patch of Duskwing's Fur and return it to Nathanos Blightcaller.It is said that Duskwing roams the countryside to the north of Marris Stead.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Duskwing, Oh How I Hate Thee...",lore="Yes, imbecile, perhaps you are ready for a more involved set of missions. The albino demon bat, Duskwing, roams the countryside just north of here."},
    [16996]={name="Gorewood Bow",quality=3,ilvl=62,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Scarlet Oracle, Demetria'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Nathanos Blightcaller in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: The Scarlet Crusade is on the move. Somewhere along the road from Tyr's Hand to Stratholme you will find the Oracle, Demetria, and her entourage. Hunt her down and slay her. Return to Nathanos Blightcaller should you succeed.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="The Scarlet Oracle, Demetria",lore="Demetria is chief advisor to the Grand Crusader. She is called the Oracle due to her 'otherworldly' senses. She has successfully assisted the Crusade in several of their victories against the Scourge."},
    [17003]={name="Skullstone Hammer",quality=2,ilvl=61,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Corpulent One'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Nathanos Blightcaller in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Find Borelgore in the northern wastes of Eastern Plaguelands and destroy him. Return to Nathanos Blightcaller when the mission is complete.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="The Corpulent One",lore="Past the Argent Dawn encampment of Light's Hope and west of Northdale, you will find the corpulent maggot beast, Borelgore. I've lost entire regiments to that monster."},
    [17005]={name="Boorguard Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'King of the Foulweald'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Karang Amakkar in Ashenvale. Objective: Place Karang's Banner on the Foulweald Totem Mound. Do not let the furbolgs destroy the banner. Defeat Chief Murgut and bring Murgut's Totem to Karang Amakkar at Zoram'gar.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="King of the Foulweald",lore="another tribe of Furbolgs, the Foulweald, live southeast of Astranaar. They are not as many as the Thistlefur, but their ferocity poses a future threat."},
    [17047]={name="Luminescent Amice",quality=2,ilvl=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Fallen Sky Lake'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Pelturas Whitemoon in Ashenvale. Objective: Retrieve a Fallen Moonstone from the Shadethicket Oracle, then bring it to Pelturas in Astranaar.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Fallen Sky Lake",lore="Relara's fever has passed, but she is still very weak. I do not believe time alone will give her back the strength she has lost. I believe it will take the power of a moonstone."},
    [17071]={name="Gutgore Ripper",quality=4,ilvl=69,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Garr.",zone="Molten Core",npc="Garr",lore="A lieutenant of Ragnaros who fights surrounded by his Firesworn, and grows stronger each time one of them falls.",proc="Chance on hit: Sends a shadowy bolt at the enemy causing 75 Shadow damage and lowering all stats by 25 for 30 sec."},
    [17072]={name="Blastershot Launcher",quality=4,ilvl=70,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Golemagg the Incinerator.",zone="Molten Core",npc="Golemagg the Incinerator",lore="A core rager grown past all the others, flanked by two hounds that cannot be killed while he stands."},
    [17692]={name="Horn Ring",quality=2,ilvl=23,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Vorsha the Lasher'. Starts with Muglash in Ashenvale. Objective: Keep Muglash safe as he travels to the brazier. Help him by putting the brazier out, then protect him as you fight against the Naga.If you are successful, return to the Zoram'gar Outpost and inform the Warsong Runner of the death of Vorsha the Lasher.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Vorsha the Lasher",lore="Vorsha the Lasher... the fiendish hydra that roams the seas... She has attacked our outpost, each time unprovoked, laying waste to anything that falls in her path."},
    [17705]={name="Thrash Blade",quality=3,ilvl=53,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Corruption of Earth and Seed'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Selendra in Maraudon. Objective: Slay Princess Theradras and return to Selendra near Shadowprey Village in Desolace.",zone="Maraudon",questName="Corruption of Earth and Seed",lore="Deep in Maraudon lives an evil creature of chaos--Princess Theradras is an elemental force of earth related to the Old Gods. Ages ago, she and Zaetar, first son of Cenarius, began a relationship.",proc="Chance on hit: Grants an extra attack on your next swing."},
    [17715]={name="Eye of Theradras",quality=3,ilvl=54,reqLevel=48,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Princess Theradras.",zone="Maraudon",npc="Princess Theradras",lore="A princess of the earth elementals and the reason Maraudon is poisoned -- she holds the body of Zaetar, her demigod consort, at its heart."},
    [17719]={name="Inventor's Focal Sword",quality=3,ilvl=53,reqLevel=48,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Tinkerer Gizlock.",zone="Maraudon",npc="Tinkerer Gizlock"},
    [17738]={name="Claw of Celebras",quality=3,ilvl=52,reqLevel=46,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Celebras the Cursed.",zone="Maraudon",npc="Celebras the Cursed",proc="Chance on hit: Poisons target for 9 Nature damage every 2 sec for 20 sec."},
    [17901]={name="Stormpike Insignia Rank 3",quality=2,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Honored Amongst the Guard'. Starts with Lieutenant Haggerdin in Alterac Mountains. Objective: ProgressThe base buzzes with news of your exploits in the Field of Strife! You have struck mighty blows against our enemy - crushing their morale! For this, you have earned a rank of honor among the Stormpike.Present your insignia.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="Honored Amongst the Guard",lore="You have struck mighty blows against our enemy - crushing their morale! For this, you have earned a rank of honor among the Stormpike.",proc="Use: Returns you to the sanctuary of Dun Baldar. (2 Min Cooldown)"},
    [17903]={name="Stormpike Insignia Rank 5",quality=3,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Legendary Heroes'. Starts with Lieutenant Haggerdin in Alterac Mountains. Objective: ProgressBefore me stands an exalted hero of the Alliance.&lt;Lieutenant Haggerdin salutes.&gt;Few have earned such a rank among the Stormpike. I have watched the enemy fall before you. I have seen their resolve crumble in your presence. When you enter the fray, you become the beacon of hope for our forces!Present your insignia.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="Legendary Heroes",lore="Rise and be honored! Present your insignia.",proc="Use: Returns you to the sanctuary of Dun Baldar. (2 Min Cooldown)"},
    [17904]={name="Stormpike Insignia Rank 6",quality=4,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Eye of Command'. Starts with Warmaster Laggrond in Alterac Mountains. Objective: ProgressDrek'Thar sings your praises. Kalimdor is abuzz with tales of your heroics. The Warchief glows - your stalwart defense of our clan has pleased him greatly.You have earned the Eye of Command.Present your insignia, Commander &lt;name&gt;.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="The Eye of Command",lore="Your time has come again. You have earned a new ranking and as such, a new insignia denoting this rise in stature.",proc="Use: Returns you to the sanctuary of Dun Baldar."},
    [17906]={name="Frostwolf Insignia Rank 3",quality=2,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Honored Amongst the Clan'. Starts with Warmaster Laggrond in Alterac Mountains. Objective: ProgressIt is good to see you again, &lt;class&gt;. I had not expected you to return. Alas, you have proven yourself a brave and honorable soldier of the Frostwolf.Your time has come again, &lt;name&gt;. You have earned a new ranking and as such, a new insignia denoting this rise in stature.Present your insignia.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="Honored Amongst the Clan",lore="I had not expected you to return. Alas, you have proven yourself a brave and honorable soldier of the Frostwolf.",proc="Use: Returns you to the sanctuary of Frostwolf Keep. (2 Min Cooldown)"},
    [17908]={name="Frostwolf Insignia Rank 5",quality=3,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Legendary Heroes'. Starts with Lieutenant Haggerdin in Alterac Mountains. Objective: ProgressBefore me stands an exalted hero of the Alliance.&lt;Lieutenant Haggerdin salutes.&gt;Few have earned such a rank among the Stormpike. I have watched the enemy fall before you. I have seen their resolve crumble in your presence. When you enter the fray, you become the beacon of hope for our forces!Present your insignia.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="Legendary Heroes",lore="Your radiate command and power, shaman. Exalted in the eyes of Frostwolf - the enemy cowers at the mention of your name.",proc="Use: Returns you to the sanctuary of Frostwolf Keep. (2 Min Cooldown)"},
    [17909]={name="Frostwolf Insignia Rank 6",quality=4,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Eye of Command'. Starts with Warmaster Laggrond in Alterac Mountains. Objective: ProgressDrek'Thar sings your praises. Kalimdor is abuzz with tales of your heroics. The Warchief glows - your stalwart defense of our clan has pleased him greatly.You have earned the Eye of Command.Present your insignia, Commander &lt;name&gt;.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="The Eye of Command",lore="You have earned the Eye of Command. Present your insignia, Commander.",proc="Use: Returns you to the sanctuary of Frostwolf Keep."},
